    "turn_text": "Every so often I talk about a local for less deal where you can pay essentially half the price. And some of the offerings there are fewer than others. Some are timely and so they go very, very, very quickly. And then others, there's a volume of them that allows for those to stay available for a period of time. And in fact, if you go to ksgf.com and the rotating tiles, there will be a local for less Ozarks and you click on it. than I think from that page is another link, but you can find that there are a number of deals that are active. Right now, there is 37 North expeditions. There is beyond the lens, techno-tainment. That is a Branson offering. Clay Cooper Theatre, Getaway Golf, which is here in Springfield, fantastic mini-golf place. Piercero Branson Theatre, there are for $70, you get $140 worth of golfing at Springfield Golf and Country Club. suntan city and the view at kimberling city. So all of those are currently available if you want to every so often check that out see what is available what has not sold out and they you will note they're all 50% off your normal pricing. So the view for example which is a great food and entertainment venue in Kimberlin City. I've not been there, but people I've talked to really enjoy it. For $12.50, you get a $25 gift certificate there and then Suntan City. $25, get your $50 gift certificate. That's at kschief.com under local for Leso Zark. And while you are at kschief.com, you can get yourself signed up for the app. Or you can do that actually in your marketplace. That's going to be the easiest way to do it. And with that, you will get notifications on Friday about an offering only announced on the KSGF app through the notification for Godfathers. This last Friday, it was free delivery, I believe. I was actually at Godfathers, so it seemed sort of redundant, I suppose, to some degree to utilize that since I was already there and then have just delivered there. Obviously, I wasn't going to do that. But it varies in terms of the different deals that you get. And so the delivery one is for a lot of people Friday night, something that is significant, given that the four Godfather area stores Nixa, Ozark Battlefield, and Springfield, they do delivery. So you can download the app and get those deals. Congressman Burleson, he is gonna be joining us here in just about five minutes or so. Look at the latest from him, Biden investigations also. I mean, the lengths, the media is going in order to try and discredit Mike Johnson, the new speaker of the house. I saw that the Atlantic had some story about his great, great, great grandfather was in the Civil War and he, are you, what? the embarrassing. Oh, and they're making a big to-do. He and his wife, when they were, I think, first married, had adopted at the age of 14 a youth, who was black. He's a he's adult now, and they're making a huge deal out of the fact that he doesn't politicize that. Some people, especially if you're a Democrat, you know, you get out there and, oh, look at me, look at, well, he didn't do that. In fact, when he first was running evidently for office, The other kids were still kids that live at home, but the son that they had, well, taken in. I don't even know that they ever legally adopted him, but just took care of him and raised him from the age of 14. He was an adult, married, black man living in California with a family, and he did not, as you can understand why, did not want to be involved politically. You know, here he's a black guy in California and the, you know, raised by a Republican, as you can understand, he's like, I just, you know, I don't want any part of that. So of course the media, why? Why is Mike Johnson hiding the fact that he had a black son? You know, it's just your typical embarrassing low-level Democrat activism masquerading as journalism in this country. Latest news update.",
